# RegnerWerk repos & domains (ironclad)

Never mix these three projects. Each has its own local folder, GitHub repo, and domain.

## 1) Marketing website (own domain / site)

- **Local:** `/Users/vlad/Documents/RegnerWerk/RegnerWerk-Web-site/RegnerWerk-WebSite` (parent folder may be named `RegnerWerk-Web-site` or `RegnerWerk-WebSite`)
- **GitHub:** https://github.com/geigedigital-rgb/RegnerWerk-WebSite
