- Remotes must stay:
  - Website → `https://github.com/geigedigital-rgb/RegnerWerk-WebSite.git`
  - Configurator → `https://github.com/geigedigital-rgb/RegnerWerk.git`
  - Backend → `https://github.com/geigedigital-rgb/RegnerWerk-Backend.git`

